INSTALLATION:

This text assumes you are using Workbench 1.3, and have placed the board's
files and sub-directories on a floppy disk.  Once the Demo has been
installed, double-click the icon "StartBBS" to run it.  Nothing else is
needed.  Make sure you have turned the modem on before doing so.  A
standard Hayes-type modem is required.

To obtain further help, log-on locally (using "Logon As Sysop" from the
"Use the Board" menu), and enter the letter "h" at the Main Menu prompt.

